# 2025-05-03 17:08:57.216599
+Create a simple Tetris game using React and Vite.
+
+The game should include:
+1.  A game board grid (e.g., 10x20).
+2.  Falling tetrominoes (the standard Tetris shapes).
+3.  Player controls using arrow keys:
+    * Left/Right: Move the piece horizontally.
+    * Up: Rotate the piece.
+    * Down: Move the piece down faster (soft drop).
+4.  Automatic downward movement of the piece over time.
+5.  Collision detection with the bottom of the board and other pieces.
+6.  Line clearing when a horizontal line is filled.
+7.  A game over condition when pieces stack up to the top.
+8.  A simple score display (e.g., points per line cleared).
+
+Use functional components and hooks. Keep the styling minimal for now.

